---
title: "Photon CLI"
description: "Manage Photon accounts, projects, and platform resources from your terminal."
---

Photon CLI is a typed command-line client for Photon. Use it to sign in, switch
between projects, buy and configure phone numbers and email domains, register
for 10DLC, manage API keys and webhooks, and script all of it from CI.

It installs with npm, pnpm, Yarn, or Bun, runs on Node.js 22 or newer, and also
ships as a standalone binary for macOS, Linux, and Windows.

```sh
npm install --global @photon-ai/cli
photon login
photon project list
```

